WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.857 --> 00:00:09.877
If something isn't working, or you're not sure what to do next, you can ask us for help from any page. Scroll to the bottom, and select Get help.

2
00:00:10.379 --> 00:00:18.619
Because you're signed in, we already know who you are, what your role is, and which school you're with. You don't need to explain any of that.

3
00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:23.939
Choose what you need help with. This helps us send your request to the right place.

4
00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:35.120
Once you choose a topic, a short list of quick answers appears at the top of the page. Take a look, because one of them might fix things right away. If not, carry on.

5
00:00:35.622 --> 00:00:45.822
Add a short subject. Then describe what's happening. Say what you were trying to do, and what you saw instead. The more detail you give, the faster we can help.

6
00:00:46.323 --> 00:00:52.683
Please don't put student names, P-I-Ns or passwords in your message. We will never ask for them.

7
00:00:53.185 --> 00:00:55.015
Select Send request.

8
00:00:55.517 --> 00:01:04.567
You get a reference number. Keep it, because it's how we find your request. We answer right here on this page, so there's no email to wait for.

9
00:01:05.069 --> 00:01:11.069
Your request now appears under Your requests, with its status. Received means we have it.

10
00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:17.891
When we reply, you'll see a New reply tag beside your request. Open it to read what we wrote.

11
00:01:18.392 --> 00:01:27.812
If you have more to tell us, or the problem is fixed, add to the conversation here, and select Send. That puts your request back in front of us.

12
00:01:28.313 --> 00:01:41.213
A request moves through four states. Received. We're on it. Waiting for you, which means we're waiting on an answer from you. And Resolved. If you write back to a resolved request, it reopens.

13
00:01:41.715 --> 00:01:49.525
Want a quick answer first? The Help center has answers to the questions we hear most. You'll find it at the bottom of every page.
